    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Positioned in an elevated setting within the established Woodland Heights development, this well-maintained detached bungalow enjoys pleasant views over Carrick-on-Suir while offering the convenience of town living. Within walking distance of the town centre and everyday amenities, the property combines a peaceful residential setting with easy access to everything you need.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent structural and decorative condition throughout, the home offers bright, comfortable accommodation that is ready for its next owners to enjoy. The layout includes an entrance porch leading to a welcoming hallway, a spacious sitting room, a kitchen with dining area, three well-proportioned bedrooms, and a family bathroom, providing a practical arrangement suited to a variety of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, a mature south-facing garden creates a private outdoor space to relax, entertain or enjoy throughout the day. The separate garage offers valuable additional storage or workspace, complementing the flexibility of the home.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to downsize without compromising on outdoor space, purchase your first detached home, or find a comfortable family residence close to local amenities, this attractive bungalow offers a rare combination of privacy, convenience and excellent presentation in one of Carrick-on-Suir's established residential locations.\r\n\r\nFor more information, visit: https://listings.sheeandhawe.com/21-woodland-heights"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Elevated position with views over Carrick-on-Suir\r\n\r\nMature residential setting\r\n\r\nSouth-facing private rear garden\r\n\r\nExcellent structural and decorative condition throughout\r\n\r\nWalking distance to the town centre\r\n\r\nSeparate garage providing valuable additional storage or workspace\r\n\r\nMature rear garden offering privacy and outdoor enjoyment\r\n\r\nConvenient access to local amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1"
      }
